---
import Button from '../components/blocks/Button.astro';
import Img from '../components/blocks/Img.astro';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Section from '../components/Section.astro';
import Text from '../components/blocks/Text.astro';
import blueIvoryPurpleBlend from '../assets/images/blue-ivory-purple-blend.png';
import blueIvoryPurpleCorners from '../assets/images/blue-ivory-purple-corners.png';
import gradient36abaf04 from '../assets/images/gradient-36abaf04.png';
import pexelsYankrukov5793808 from '../assets/images/pexels-yankrukov-5793808.jpg';
import socialShare6a8726b0 from '../assets/images/social-share-6a8726b0.png';
import unsplashImageU2h4br0Nls217811 from '../assets/images/unsplash-image-u2h4br0-nls-217811.jpg';
---

<Layout title="Case Study 3 | Enhance Your SEO Reach Today | HelloSEO" description="Discover how HelloSEO helped a pelvic health clinic achieve a 238% increase in organic traffic and rank #1 on Google. Learn more about our SEO success stories." ogImage={socialShare6a8726b0}>
  <Section height="medium" bg={{ src: blueIvoryPurpleBlend, overlay: 0.15, eager: true }} grid={{ rows: [63, 36], rowGap: 11, colGap: 34 }}>
    <Text m="1/2/21/10" d="1/3/15/14" z={1} zm={3}>
      <h1>How a Pelvic Health Clinic Got 252 New Client Leads in 6 Months</h1>
      <p>As a physical therapy clinic, finding local clients who specifically need pelvic health support can be challenging. This practice needed a way to stand out so people searching for specialized care could easily find them.</p>
      <p>We updated their website so when local patients search for pelvic health services, the practice appears right at the top of Google.</p>
      <p>Within 24 hours of starting, their website hit the #1 spot on Google for their main search term. Over six months, they gained 252 new client leads—with 69% of all their new patients coming directly from Google searches. Best of all, they have kept those top Google rankings for over three years.</p>
    </Text>
    <Img m="23/2/37/10" d="1/17/18/25" z={4} zm={6} align="center" outline={{ border: '4px solid #fff', radius: '34px' }} src={pexelsYankrukov5793808} alt="Two people standing close together, one with their hand on their hip, in an indoor setting with neutral-colored walls." radius="30px" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 33vw" eager />
    <Text m="36/2/49/10" d="16/3/26/14" z={5} align="center" alignM="start" bg="var(--darkAccent)" padding="6% 6% 6% 6%" radius="30px" bulletColor="#fff4ea">
      <h4><span class="c-white">The Problem:&nbsp;</span></h4>
      <ul>
      <li>
      <p><span class="c-white"><strong>Hard to Find Locally:</strong> Relying on word-of-mouth wasn't enough to fill their schedule with local patients.</span></p>
      </li>
      <li>
      <p><span class="c-white"><strong>Specialized Care Needs:</strong> Needed a way to reach people searching for specific pelvic health support using clear, comfortable language.</span></p>
      </li>
      <li>
      <p><span class="c-white"><strong>Low Search Visibility:</strong> Facing tough competition from larger healthcare networks online.</span></p>
      </li>
      </ul>
    </Text>
    <Text m="49/2/64/10" d="26/3/37/14" z={6} align="center" bg="var(--accent)" padding="6% 6% 6% 6%" radius="30px">
      <h4><span class="c-black">What We Did: </span></h4>
      <ul>
      <li>
      <p><strong>Instant Keyword Optimization:</strong> Updated core service pages so Google immediately recognized them as the top local provider for pelvic health.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
      <p><strong>Understood Their Audience:</strong> Formatted page copy using the exact terms and questions pelvic health patients search for.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
      <p><strong>Built Long-Term Search Authority:</strong> Set up a clean, technical website structure that maintains high rankings over time without relying on paid ads.</p>
      </li>
      </ul>
    </Text>
  </Section>

  <Section theme="dark" height="small" grid={{ rows: [23, 12], rowGap: 11, colGap: 11 }}>
    <Text m="2/2/4/10" d="2/10/4/18" z={1}>
      <h2 class="ta-center">The Results</h2>
    </Text>
    <Text m="5/2/11/10" d="5/2/11/10" z={4} zm={6} align="center" bg padding="6% 6% 6% 6%" radius="30px">
      <h3 class="ta-center"><span class="c-darkAccent">More Website Visitors: </span></h3>
      <p class="ta-center"><span class="c-darkAccent"><strong>238% increase</strong> in organic search traffic over six months.</span></p>
    </Text>
    <Text m="11/2/17/10" d="5/10/11/18" z={5} zm={7} align="center" bg padding="6% 6% 6% 6%" radius="30px">
      <h3 class="ta-center"><span class="c-darkAccent">Steady Stream of Leads:</span></h3>
      <p class="ta-center"><span class="c-darkAccent"><strong>252 new client leads </strong>in six months.</span></p>
    </Text>
    <Text m="17/2/23/10" d="5/18/11/26" z={6} zm={8} align="center" bg padding="6% 6% 6% 6%" radius="30px">
      <h3 class="ta-center">Google Dominance: </h3>
      <p class="ta-center"><strong>69% of all new leads</strong> come from Google, starting with a <strong>#1 spot on day one</strong> that has stayed strong for <strong>3+ years</strong>.</p>
    </Text>
  </Section>

  <Section theme="light" height="small" bg={{ src: unsplashImageU2h4br0Nls217811, overlay: 0.9, parallax: true }} grid={{ rows: [11, 8], rowGap: 28, colGap: 28 }}>
    <Text m="1/2/12/10" d="2/6/8/22" z={4} zm={3} align="center" radius="20px">
      <h3><span class="c-white">“Working with Jade has been an absolute game-changer for my business.</span></h3>
      <p class="large"><span class="c-white">As a pelvic floor physical therapy clinic, we rely heavily on local search visibility—and thanks to Jade’s SEO expertise, our website is now one of the top search results in our area. She took the time to understand my business, my clients, and the unique language of pelvic health. With her help, we’ve not only improved our rankings, but we’re consistently getting found by the right clients—people who are looking for exactly what we offer. I can’t recommend Jade enough!”</span></p>
      <p class="large"><span class="c-white"><strong>Hannah Strom, Awake Pelvic Health</strong></span></p>
    </Text>
  </Section>

  <Section height="small" grid={{ rows: [17, 14], rowGap: 11, colGap: 26 }}>
    <Img m="3/2/16/10" d="3/3/13/25" z={2} align="center" outline={{ border: '4px solid #d34320', radius: '34px' }} src={blueIvoryPurpleCorners} alt="Blurred pastel gradient background with shades of pink, blue, and white." radius="30px" parallax={{ intensity: 20, rotation: 45, zoomStart: 2 }} sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 92vw" />
    <Img m="2/4/5/8" d="2/12/5/16" z={4} align="center" anim={{ animations: [{ trigger: 'loop', duration: 2, ease: 'ease-in-out', frames: [{ y: '20%', sx: 0.95, sy: 0.95 }] }] }} src={gradient36abaf04} alt="A cartoon illustration of a smiling white cat with a curled tail, set against a red background." fit="contain" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 50vw, 17vw" />
    <Text m="6/3/9/9" d="6/8/8/20" z={4}>
      <h2 class="ta-center">Ready to take the next step?</h2>
    </Text>
    <Button m="10/3/12/9" d="9/9/11/14" z={3} align="center" href="/results">View More Results</Button>
    <Button m="12/3/14/9" d="9/14/11/19" z={4} align="center" href="/contact" variant="secondary" size="large">Get Started</Button>
  </Section>
</Layout>
